i><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Download Resolution No. 2026-18 - A Resolution Recommending Approving of Revision to Division 6 of Chapter 16 of the Bennett Municipal Code to Add Section 16-1-615 Designating Certain Structures and Flatwork That Predate January 1, 2021, as Legal Nonconforming Structures" href="https://towncloud-core-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/bennett-co/meetings/item_attachment/attachment/8879/5._PNZResolution_Final_(1).pdf">Resolution No. 2026-18 - A Resolution Recommending Approving of Revision to Division 6 of Chapter 16 of the Bennett Municipal Code to Add Section 16-1-615 Designating Certain Structures and Flatwork That Predate January 1, 2021, as Legal Nonconforming Structures</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Download Suggested Motion" href="https://towncloud-core-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/bennett-co/meetings/item_attachment/attachment/8875/6._suggested_motion.pdf">Suggested Motion</a></li></ul></div></div></li></ol></div></li><li class="item"><h5>Town Development Updates</h5><div class="item-contents-wrap"><div class="item-agenda-subhead">Steven Hoese, Planning Manager</div><div class="item-agenda-text"><p>Click the link below to view the Town of Bennett Development Project Status.</p>

